   "title": "About this workflow",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "The 3D layout of a normal photo guides the new picture: Depth Anything V2 makes a depth map (white = near, black = far), shown as the Depth map preview.\nAlready have a depth map? Turn \"Make depth map from photo\" off and the input is used as it is.\nThe output takes the input's shape at about 0.4 megapixels (Output size).\nControlNet strength 0.9; End = when it lets go (0.8 leaves the last steps free for detail).\nModel file: t2iadapter_depth_sd14v1.pth.\nThe first run downloads the detector model (comfyui_controlnet_aux), so it takes a minute longer.\n\nModel: SD 1.5 checkpoints (realistic or anime). Default: Realistic Vision 6.\nDefaults: 25 steps, CFG 6.0, dpmpp_2m / karras."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
